gt6addition.machine.hu_crucible.tooltip.1=§7GT6 style crucible: HU/VIS_IGNIS heating, CU cooling, KU air blowing. VIS_IGNIS requires an external provider; KU does not directly heat it.
gt6addition.machine.hu_crucible.tooltip.2=§9Capacity: §f%s ingots
gt6addition.machine.hu_crucible.tooltip.3=§cHeat limit: §f%s K
gt6addition.machine.hu_crucible.tooltip.acid_proof=§6Acid proof
gt6addition.machine.hu_crucible.tooltip.safe_input=§7Pending items are processed FIFO. Supported CEu tools use recipe materials and remaining durability. Electric tools require complete crafting material records; stored EU does not become heat. Vanilla durability recycling scales pristine-only data. Containers, unknown or ambiguous recipes and unsupported custom NBT are retained. Held fluid containers can pour normally.
