gt6addition.machine.hu_crucible.tooltip.scrape=§7Dropped items enter from the top; empty-hand top clicks retrieve the input slot, then the queue head. With no pending items, use an empty hand or shovel to scrape solids.
gt6addition.machine.hu_crucible.tooltip.automatic_rate=§7Automatic intake processes at most one item per tick. Extra valid items enter a FIFO buffer of up to 64 items.
gt6addition.top.multi_energy.available=Available energy: %s %s
gt6addition.machine.hu_crucible.tooltip.hazard=§4Contact or retrieval burns above 320 K and freezes below 260 K; also beware of overheating, acid, fire, and explosions.
gt6addition.machine.hu_crucible.tooltip.entity_recycling=§7Hot contact deaths add matching registered GT6 materials; missing targets or insufficient capacity prevent conversion.
